{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1795059009005629747,"compiled_state":{"alias":"oniony-ostracized-arawana","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"aa3665271bde49fbe820a6747b40dc9bef780e9e88c37337cc03cc731c076dfe","event_uuid":"187840fb-1f1f-4baa-86d3-43e316e7270d","position":{"commit_sha":"6c7a03dcc53b1ccb1c98d8828fdb65c53428e569","position":"1795058895572871123-187840fb-1f1f-4baa-86d3-43e316e7270d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"9f110552e36709ef57d157dd5bd39d84b8e0434b0ac15621a9590570095bc8ce","event_uuid":"1d14cf1a-e506-456d-b26a-f426c6c3d96d","position":{"commit_sha":"0c8ad69da43360350f8d616b160834c70a876b6f","position":"1795059009005629746-1d14cf1a-e506-456d-b26a-f426c6c3d96d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1795058895572871123,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"1d14cf1a-e506-456d-b26a-f426c6c3d96d","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"44b2-e70e-2b9f-4d2a"}],"description":"## Observation\nGerrit 3440 patch set 1 (9771ff17b27) got `Verified -1` from run 44445060532, job 135298967486 (`build-and-test / pytest (ubuntu-latest, py3.12)`, git 2.56.1, 2026-11-19). The only failure was `tests/unit/test_recent_creates_shared_journal.py::test_a_linked_worktree_tracker_keeps_the_journal_in_its_own_git_dir` (`:196-212`): the setup command `git worktree add -q --detach <tmp>/repo/.tickets-tracker` exited 128 with `fatal: could not open '.git/worktrees/-tickets-tracker/locked' for writing: No such file or directory`. The change under test does not touch this test or the code it exercises (op-cert key loading, the comment-echo cleanup script, docs, the Windows sweep workflow). The module passed 5 of 5 times locally on macOS.\n\nThe repo is a fresh `git init` under the test's own `tmp_path`, so nothing else should touch its `.git/worktrees/`. git writes `locked` right after creating `.git/worktrees/<id>/`; ENOENT means that directory was gone or never created at that path.\n\n## Hypotheses (unproven)\n- A concurrent `git worktree prune` against this repo (callers: `src/rebar/_commands/init.py:186`, `src/rebar/llm/evals/plan_replay/tier2.py:304`), reached through an inherited `GIT_DIR`/cwd from a detached child of an earlier test on the same xdist worker.\n- A git 2.56.x worktree-id sanitisation issue for a dot-led basename (`.tickets-tracker` becomes `-tickets-tracker`).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The interleaving or condition that produces the ENOENT is reproduced deterministically and recorded here.\n- [ ] The test passes reliably under that condition, with the class fixed.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["flaky"],"ticket_id":"7fcc-dac7-6f05-4ad1","ticket_type":"bug","title":"test_a_linked_worktree_tracker_keeps_the_journal_in_its_own_git_dir: `git worktree add` intermittently fails on its own .git/worktrees lock file","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["187840fb-1f1f-4baa-86d3-43e316e7270d","1d14cf1a-e506-456d-b26a-f426c6c3d96d"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795059009005629747,"uuid":"9fe09bc7-ff1e-48a8-acd4-e263147200a5"}
